{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14049","headline":"晚登虔州即事寄李侍御 · 耿湋","name":"晚登虔州即事寄李侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"章溪与贡水，何事会波澜。\n万里归人少，孤舟行路难。\n春光浮曲浪，暮色隔连滩。\n花发从南早，江流向北宽。\n故交参盛府，新角耸危冠。\n楚劒期终割，隋珠惜未弹。\n酒醒愁转极，别远泪初乾。\n愿保乔松质，青青过大寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}